@startuml sd04-notify-fallback
' ============================================================
' SD-04 通知投递与失败降级
' 对应 REQ-F-023、REQ-N-004、详细设计 构件 5
' 重点：站内必达、通道顺序、每次尝试留痕、重启补扫
' ============================================================
title SD-04 通知投递与失败降级

skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #3F6B3A
  LifeLineBorderColor #3F6B3A
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F3F8F2
  ParticipantBorderColor #3F6B3A
}

participant "业务服务" as BIZ
participant "通知服务\nnotify.enqueue" as NOTIFY
database "DB" as DB
participant "调度 tick()" as TICK
participant "微信适配器" as WX
participant "邮件适配器" as MAIL

BIZ -> NOTIFY : enqueue(user, type, title, body)
NOTIFY -> DB : INSERT notification（站内必达）
NOTIFY -> DB : 按用户已绑定通道 INSERT delivery ×N（pending）
NOTIFY --> BIZ : 入队完成（不阻塞业务）

== 后台调度 ==
TICK -> DB : SELECT delivery WHERE status='pending' AND plan_at<=now
TICK -> DB : UPDATE delivery SET status='sending' WHERE id=? AND status='pending'
Note right of DB : 乐观锁，重复 tick 不会重复发送
TICK -> WX : send(msg)
WX --> TICK : 失败（40001 凭据失效 / 超时）
TICK -> DB : INSERT delivery_log(wechat, failed, latency)
TICK -> MAIL : send(msg)
MAIL --> TICK : 成功
TICK -> DB : UPDATE delivery SET status='sent'、INSERT delivery_log(email, ok)
TICK -> DB : UPDATE 其余通道 SET status='skipped'
Note right of DB : 任一通道成功后其余置 skipped，
                 避免用户收到两条重复通知

== 服务重启 ==
TICK -> DB : SELECT delivery WHERE status='sending' AND updated_at < now-5min
TICK -> DB : UPDATE 回退为 pending → 下一轮补发
Note right of DB : 补扫不重复：靠 claim_delivery 的条件更新

@enduml
